# Ralph-loop harness state. Session-local bookkeeping — it carries an iteration
# counter and a machine-specific session id, and was being rewritten by every
# commit that used `git add -A`. The .local suffix is the convention for a file
# that should not be tracked; it was committed by accident in an earlier session.
.claude/ralph-loop.local.md
